<title>TURKEY: Turkey details Jan-Sept white sugar output.</title>
<headline>Turkey details Jan-Sept white sugar output.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's white sugar output, excluding whites produced from imported raws, rose to 351,404 tonnes in the first nine months of this year from 162,270 in the same 1995 period, the State Institute of Statistics said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said 281,088 tonnes of this year's total to September was produced by 25 state refineries operated by Turkseker, the rest by three private refineries.</p>
<p>Turkey expects sugar output to rise to 1.85 million tonnes in 1996/97 from 1.5 million previously.</p>
<p>--Ercan Ersoy, Ankara Newsroom 90-312-4462940</p>
</text>
